# DIGPAK/MIDPAK per-machine drivers generated by SETUP.BAT (SETD/SETM) — see README "Audio".
# The source drivers/patches (SBPRO.COM, SBFM.ADV, FAT.OPL, …) and MIDPAK.COM are committed;
# these configured outputs are not. Full paths so the source .ADV/.AD files aren't caught.
audio/DRIVERS/SOUNDRV.COM
audio/DRIVERS/MIDPAK.ADV
audio/DRIVERS/MIDPAK.AD
audio/DRIVERS/MUSIC.ADV
audio/DRIVERS/MUSIC.AD
